 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Mothers and fathers came along",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bringing children, small and young",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Babies, sisters, brothers too",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.96,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus, we have come to you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the disciples took away",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He's too busy here today",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus saw it and he said",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bring them here to me instead",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the little children come to me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not hinder them",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the kingdom of God belongs to such as these",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the little children come",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Arms wide open, here I come",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus loves me, everyone",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Big or small or short or tall",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus has a hug for all",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He took them in his arms",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Laid his hands on them",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And blessed them",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the little children come to me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not hinder them",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For the kingdom of God belongs to such as these",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Let the little children come",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hands up high and hands down low",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus wants us all to know",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever does not receive the kingdom of God like a little child",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
